		<title type="html"><![CDATA[Re: How to disable collisions?]]></title>

		
		<content type="html" xml:base="https://pybullet.org/Bullet/phpBB3/viewtopic.php?p=41447#p41447"><![CDATA[
I just implemented a few ways to do it:<br><br>Disable collisions per object pair / link:<div class="codebox"><p>Code: </p><pre><code>enableCollision= 0pybullet.setCollisionFilterPair(objectUniqueIdA, objectUniqueIdB, linkIndexA, linkIndexB, enableCollision)</code></pre></div>or disable collisions per group of objects:<div class="codebox"><p>Code: </p><pre><code>group = 0#other objects don't collide with memask=0 # don't collide with any other objectpybullet. setCollisionFilterGroupMask(objectUniqueId, linkIndex, group, mask)</code></pre></div><p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="https://pybullet.org/Bullet/phpBB3/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=2">Erwin Coumans</a> — Thu Sep 13, 2018 3:32 am</p><hr />
]]></content>
	</entry>
