		<title type="html"><![CDATA[Re: How to disable collisions?]]></title>

		
		<content type="html" xml:base="https://pybullet.org/Bullet/phpBB3/viewtopic.php?p=41395#p41395"><![CDATA[
You can use visual shapes without collision shapes. For example, your URDF code can be:<br><div class="codebox"><p>Code: </p><pre><code>&lt;?xml version="1.0"?&gt;&lt;robot name="cube"&gt;  &lt;link name="base_link"&gt;    &lt;collision&gt;      &lt;geometry&gt;        &lt;box size="0 0 0"/&gt;      &lt;/geometry&gt;    &lt;/collision&gt;    &lt;inertial&gt;      &lt;mass value="0"/&gt;    &lt;inertia ixx="0" ixy="0" ixz="0" iyy="0" iyz="0" izz="0"/&gt;  &lt;/inertial&gt;    &lt;visual&gt;      &lt;geometry&gt;        &lt;box size="1 1 1"/&gt;      &lt;/geometry&gt;    &lt;/visual&gt;  &lt;/link&gt;&lt;/robot&gt;</code></pre></div><p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="https://pybullet.org/Bullet/phpBB3/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=12388">ardabbour</a> — Mon Sep 03, 2018 11:35 am</p><hr />
]]></content>
